ssue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113213","id":5376884588,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABQHy_bA","user":{"login":"0xbeefd1ed","id":256028631,"node_id":"U_kgDOD0Kv1w","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/256028631?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xbeefd1ed","html_url":"https://github.com/0xbeefd1ed","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xbeefd1ed/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xbeefd1ed/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xbeefd1ed/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xbeefd1ed/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xbeefd1ed/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xbeefd1ed/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xbeefd1ed/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xbeefd1ed/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xbeefd1ed/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-22T00:51:32Z","updated_at":"2026-08-22T00:51:32Z","body":"> The Vulkan backend works great and is our most polished graphics API backend. The problem we are solving here is the fact that every couple of months AMD and NVidia ship broken Vulkan drivers that break every single Godot game. We can't improve the quality of the drivers shipped by AMD and NVidia, so our only option is to avoid Vulkan on Windows\r\n\r\n@clayjohn / @akien-mga Does Godot have any arrangements with AMD or NVIDIA that allows Godot frame captures to be included in their CI pipelines?\r\n\r\nFor each of those regressions, AMD / NVIDIA can create a new test in the Vulkan CTS suite to ensure that this doesn't happen again. For comprehensive end-to-end testing GPU vendors typically work with game developers to create GPU traces using tools like [GFXReconstruct](https://github.com/LunarG/gfxreconstruct). For every driver version that they release they can compare the produced images so that they will never ship a broken driver.\r\n\r\nI suspect that the reason this is happening is due to a lack of AAA Godot developers with a relationship with AMD / NVIDIA.\r\n\r\nThere are strong ecosystem reasons to use Vulkan over DX12. See my comment in the other thread https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/12234#issuecomment-5376745497","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5376884588/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":0,"-1":3,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]